s/origins/39fd9cf2-67d5-4acb-ac5f-49f9a7333684?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=40df8d3bf844a3f8d4a6d40f9041bc74 3x"}, "body": "こんにちは 初めてご依頼させていただきます。 \n Twitterの223系と221系の自作ラベルを拝見させて頂きました。\n私も、TOMIXのパッケージ風イラストをお願いしたいです。\n 車両はTOMIX98466・98468 221系近ﾎｼA1編成未更新車とKATO 10-1492 221系近ﾎｼC2編成更新車で、離合するような感じでお願いします。\n 未更新車は前照灯点灯で[A]快速 、更新車はテールライトで[A]快速 網干行でお願いします。 \n もし可能であれば、223系のように、運用範囲の地図を載せていただきたいです。\n 221系未更新は2019年の体質改善直前の仕様なので、転落防止幌付・運用番号撤去・クーラー更新・種別幕路線記号ありでお願いします\n 注文が多いですが、よろしくお願いします", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ktn400AF_Cmpn/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2688903, "client_id": 3589622, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e76d3259/uploads/origins/80c663a1-08f3-4307-ad2b-2d98cedf1917?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b3d044311067e1efd096c43c36168b8e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e76d3259/uploads/origins/80c663a1-08f3-4307-ad2b-2d98cedf1917?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b3d044311067e1efd096c43c36168b8e, https://si.imgix.net/e76d3259/uploads/origins/80c663a1-08f3-4307-ad2b-2d98cedf1917?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=16d2047a14663d9651f8d089987c7fe3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e76d3259/uploads/origins/80c663a1-08f3-4307-ad2b-2d98cedf1917?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fbe278017873474d5f4c69c260ef4b03 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e76d3259/uploads/origins/80c663a1-08f3-4307-ad2b-2d98cedf1917?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c45f55ae05474ca7e6beb1231f249b64", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e76d3259/uploads/origins/80c663a1-08f3-4307-ad2b-2d98cedf1917?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c45f55ae05474ca7e6beb1231f249b64, https://si.imgix.net/e76d3259/uploads/origins/80c663a1-08f3-4307-ad2b-2d98cedf1917?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=703e7f966ff35b8f3c295f0a246b9b4d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e76d3259/uploads/origins/80c663a1-08f3-4307-ad2b-2d98cedf1917?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d9698b125bb322edd544d21d822cfb78 3x"}, "body": "お世話になります。\nTOMIXブックケース風のイラストをお願いしたいです。 車両は489系H01編成で2011年3月26日に運転された「ありがとう489系号」でお願いしたいです。(ヘッドマークが白鳥風になります。)イメージを添付します。https://search.yahoo.co.jp/image/search?p=TOMIX%2520%E3%83%91%E3%83%83%E3%82%B1%E3%83%BC%E3%82%B8&ei=UTF-8&fr=applep1&x=nl&qid=ec#05de333c3836748f1b17932cf3aa14b2\n背景は青色ベースにしたいです。スペースがありましたらヘッドマークのみのイラストも追加したいです。\n品番はKATO 10-818.10-819でお願いします。\n\nお手数おかけしますが、どうぞよろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://rail.hobidas.com/rmnews/235966/", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ktn400AF_Cmpn/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2688903, "client_id": 1463139, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e92c688f/uploads/origins/1fb4a93f-67a1-4e88-8a6e-8e3a060d4a88?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=76a05893ba0d7b4c98f592183ed26daf", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e92c688f/uploads/origins/1fb4a93f-67a1-4e88-8a6e-8e3a060d4a88?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=76a05893ba0d7b4c98f592183ed26daf, https://si.imgix.net/e92c688f/uploads/origins/1fb4a93f-67a1-4e88-8a6e-8e3a060d4a88?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e160899fb277d45e2dac5da2798b6115 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e92c688f/uploads/origins/1fb4a93f-67a1-4e88-8a6e-8e3a060d4a88?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ecb90fac7109f59a8a76768d3d1c65b2 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e92c688f/uploads/origins/1fb4a93f-67a1-4e88-8a6e-8e3a060d4a88?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fd70f7d31f28c8c3e1a8b0584f1afbe1", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e92c688f/uploads/origins/1fb4a93f-67a1-4e88-8a6e-8e3a060d4a88?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fd70f7d31f28c8c3e1a8b0584f1afbe1, https://si.imgix.net/e92c688f/uploads/origins/1fb4a93f-67a1-4e88-8a6e-8e3a060d4a88?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7ad38004b43cd2ffc132bd69808c3a72 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e92c688f/uploads/origins/1fb4a93f-67a1-4e88-8a6e-8e3a060d4a88?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0beefa3e5ee1aa803aa6c5b0da416b71 3x"}, "body": "こんにちは、お初にお目にかかります。\nTOMIXブックケースのパッケージ風のイラストをリクエストさせていただきます。\n車両は 阿武隈急行 AB900系のAB-1号車(薄藍色)＋AB-2号車(緑色の時代)の4両併結で、行先は「梁川」表示でお願いします。\n仙台直通の返しを想定しているのでAB900-1号車(青のパンタなし)が先頭になります。\n\n・組成\nAB900-1＋AB901-1(Mp)＋AB900-2＋AB901-2(Mp)\n←福島・梁川　　　　　　　　　丸森・槻木→\n\n\n細かい構図等はおまかせしますが、AB-1・AB-2号車両方の車両の色がわかるような構図でお願いしたいです。\n\n品番はマイクロエース A7120 A7121\n品名は「阿武隈急行 AB900系 AB-1号車 AB-2号車 AB-3号車」でお願いします。(AB-3はまだ製品化されていません)\n\n背景はAB900系、この3本のカラーリングの由来となった「柴田町のアジサイ(薄藍・AB-1)」「丸森町の自然(緑・AB-2)」「角田市の菜の花(黄・AB-3)」をイメージした感じでお願いしたいです。\n\n空いたスペース等あれば阿武隈急行線の路線図を組み込んでいただきたいです。福島・保原・梁川・丸森・角田・槻木などの有人駅のみの記載で構いません。\n\n注文が多くなり大変恐縮ですが、よろしくお願いいたします。", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ktn400AF_Cmpn/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2688903, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b2c73e8a/uploads/origins/ebc03e8d-bdf3-4388-a648-a7164f78f9de?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7da2c4640ccc8694f08fc8c2ee00aaca", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b2c73e8a/uploads/origins/ebc03e8d-bdf3-4388-a648-a7164f78f9de?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7da2c4640ccc8694f08fc8c2ee00aaca, https://si.imgix.net/b2c73e8a/uploads/origins/ebc03e8d-bdf3-4388-a648-a7164f78f9de?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0fc33ac16859c72e4087383494fd095d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b2c73e8a/uploads/origins/ebc03e8d-bdf3-4388-a648-a7164f78f9de?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6ed6a94cbc5042596abcb5895e507c0a 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b2c73e8a/uploads/origins/ebc03e8d-bdf3-4388-a648-a7164f78f9de?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2157d95e69cfd1ed45bb3abfef0cdd39", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b2c73e8a/uploads/origins/ebc03e8d-bdf3-4388-a648-a7164f78f9de?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2157d95e69cfd1ed45bb3abfef0cdd39, https://si.imgix.net/b2c73e8a/uploads/origins/ebc03e8d-bdf3-4388-a648-a7164f78f9de?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5ce03a42fb9cc8e64157adc54ba1e615 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b2c73e8a/uploads/origins/ebc03e8d-bdf3-4388-a648-a7164f78f9de?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=87fb1f613943cd45b6f93a11338551a9 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you! Please excuse my request.\nI would like a TOMIX book case style illustration, please.\n\nThe train should be a Keisei Type 3700, Formation 3788.\nI would like to use halogen front lights, magsigns for operation numbers, and curtains for destinations and types.\nhttps://www.gm-store.co.jp/blog/gmstore-staff/archives/8155\nI would like to have the train car, destination, type, and operation number etc. referring to the 3788 train shown in the second image at this URL.\n\nOperation number...A03\nType...Limited Express\nDestination ...Ueno\nExpress lights on (front upper left and right lights)\nPlease use the following\n\nI would be happy if the composition is a curve composition like the Meitetsu 8500 North Alps that the previous request owner requested.\n\nPart number is Greenmax 50688\nThe name of the model is \"Keisei Type 3700, 3788-3781 8-car formation set\".\nI would like to have it as \"Keisei Type 3700 3788-3781 8-car formation set\".\n\nIf possible, it would be great if there is an illustration of an airplane or airport style silhouette in the background...!\n\nI know this is a lot to ask, but I would really appreciate it.", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ktn400AF_Cmpn/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2688903, "client_id": 76978, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d2ba9811/uploads/origins/93f07a91-f7ff-4d06-bc6f-8b6c35cc4fb4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=756c5e5fdece1e51480995b0965b7ed5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d2ba9811/uploads/origins/93f07a91-f7ff-4d06-bc6f-8b6c35cc4fb4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=756c5e5fdece1e51480995b0965b7ed5, https://si.imgix.net/d2ba9811/uploads/origins/93f07a91-f7ff-4d06-bc6f-8b6c35cc4fb4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=08be2adb473c4176511bffecbbc93b8b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d2ba9811/uploads/origins/93f07a91-f7ff-4d06-bc6f-8b6c35cc4fb4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9af2bb5b2251b46166f1d0b1f3680f26 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d2ba9811/uploads/origins/93f07a91-f7ff-4d06-bc6f-8b6c35cc4fb4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0cd70175e944fa91aca0a2ba9b6543bf", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d2ba9811/uploads/origins/93f07a91-f7ff-4d06-bc6f-8b6c35cc4fb4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0cd70175e944fa91aca0a2ba9b6543bf, https://si.imgix.net/d2ba9811/uploads/origins/93f07a91-f7ff-4d06-bc6f-8b6c35cc4fb4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=dfe7c286fdd3ddb82d0b66b21b64c18e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d2ba9811/uploads/origins/93f07a91-f7ff-4d06-bc6f-8b6c35cc4fb4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f7e942d916349a28185128dd127b0a10 3x"}, "body": "Long time no see, Mr. Katonatsu.\nThank you very much for the last time.\nThe one you requested is also a Seibu 6000 series, TOMIX case style.\nThe car is the 6151 aluminum car that was recently released by Greenmax. https://www.greenmax.co.jp/gm-product/31873.html\nThe destination type should be \"Semi-express Kotesashi\".\nI don't have a detailed composition specification, but I would be happy if the composition is from the top, as if looking down on the train.\n\nAlso, if you don't mind, I'd like to see a picture of the stainless steel car from last time.\nI would like you to draw the difference between the last stainless steel car and the one for the 40th anniversary of the Seibu Yurakucho Line.\nhttps://www.greenmax.co.jp/gm-product/50764.html\nIf possible, I would appreciate it if you could do a temporary display.\nTemporary display\nhttps://x.com/seiji_yuituki/status/1813587879018574250?t=G6VD1lNDkWQSj3hgiLLiEw&s=19\nThank you very much in advance.", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ktn400AF_Cmpn/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2688903, "client_id": 1081848, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ac96d029/uploads/origins/b5121cca-5fb0-40f4-bfce-45217a12b272?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2c3189f8232fe27794a4b3567f533076", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ac96d029/uploads/origins/b5121cca-5fb0-40f4-bfce-45217a12b272?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2c3189f8232fe27794a4b3567f533076, https://si.imgix.net/ac96d029/uploads/origins/b5121cca-5fb0-40f4-bfce-45217a12b272?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=01728806eaeafac36623a93ea7dd8939 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ac96d029/uploads/origins/b5121cca-5fb0-40f4-bfce-45217a12b272?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b708d590a72bac954f3a921b2b8efb17 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ac96d029/uploads/origins/b5121cca-5fb0-40f4-bfce-45217a12b272?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d88e2447a32281c398ba9c19f93ab0a2", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ac96d029/uploads/origins/b5121cca-5fb0-40f4-bfce-45217a12b272?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d88e2447a32281c398ba9c19f93ab0a2, https://si.imgix.net/ac96d029/uploads/origins/b5121cca-5fb0-40f4-bfce-45217a12b272?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cb3816df97e998de76befa0f5f8a6cee 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ac96d029/uploads/origins/b5121cca-5fb0-40f4-bfce-45217a12b272?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=76ad328311bce517ddfc30eca15fcdc4 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you. I saw your beautiful illustration and would like to make a request for your help.\n\nI would like you to draw an illustration in the style of a TOMIX package. （I would like to use the illustration as an actual package, so that I can use it with care.)\n\nTrain: Type 14-15 Sleeping Car Express AKATSUKI (part number 92763), Sleeping Car Express Comet (part number 92278).\nWe do not have any particular composition or design requirements, but we would be very grateful if the illustrations could be used to identify each of the two trains. A map of the train's route would also be acceptable. We would also appreciate it if you could put your production credit (illustrated by...) somewhere on the package.\n\nSince it will be in one package, we will order one illustration as well. Thank you in advance.", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ktn400AF_Cmpn/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2688903, "client_id": 2632531, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/60b27c37/uploads/origins/6eb1f017-1910-499f-98a2-27c40e7959e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cb45166120fa27d2c7ea0a48104b9097", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/60b27c37/uploads/origins/6eb1f017-1910-499f-98a2-27c40e7959e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cb45166120fa27d2c7ea0a48104b9097, https://si.imgix.net/60b27c37/uploads/origins/6eb1f017-1910-499f-98a2-27c40e7959e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ba15f7142e093733d94f62b2799b3a08 2x, https://si.imgix.net/60b27c37/uploads/origins/6eb1f017-1910-499f-98a2-27c40e7959e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=555ebef5d1bbd40f962e1225c4151c77 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/60b27c37/uploads/origins/6eb1f017-1910-499f-98a2-27c40e7959e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=dfcb7f8b2590a332a62f9e50ee8c8477", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/60b27c37/uploads/origins/6eb1f017-1910-499f-98a2-27c40e7959e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=dfcb7f8b2590a332a62f9e50ee8c8477, https://si.imgix.net/60b27c37/uploads/origins/6eb1f017-1910-499f-98a2-27c40e7959e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4aebf5b64f601f6291dcf0e09f99ee1a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/60b27c37/uploads/origins/6eb1f017-1910-499f-98a2-27c40e7959e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4c09e16e25f9e41529c537a818562c15 3x"}, "body": "こんにちは。\n先日は、素敵な〝國鉄〟を描いて下さりありがとうございました。\n〝京王3000系の代わりに営団3000系が北陸鉄道に譲渡された世界線〟という設定で、浅野川線仕様の同形式を描いて頂けないでしょうか。\n\n・形式\n史実の元・京王車と同じく〝8000系〟。\n\n・車番\n「営団3000系が京王車の代わりに8000系を名乗っている＝元形式の形態差による番台区分も存在しない」ということで、先頭車の車番は「800X」でお願いします。Xに当たる数字は、１〜５の中からランダムに選んで頂いて構いません。\n\n・外観\n史実の長野電鉄3500系と同じ二両編成にオレンジ色の帯を締めている。\n\n・方向幕\n史実の北陸鉄道7000系と同じようなデザイン(区間表記に改められる以前、ローマ字併記のある様式)で「急行 内灘」(「急行」は赤地に白抜き、「内灘」は白地に黒文字)。また、方向幕併記以外でどこかしらに「ワンマン」プレートを掲示して頂ければと思います。\n\n・背景\n蚊爪〜粟ヶ崎間に掛かっている大野川橋梁を渡っているようなイメージでお願いします。あくまでイメージですので、実物に即していなくても結構です。\n\n上記の指定につきましては、描きにくい、作者様の解釈と一致しない等、対応が難しいようであれば、遠慮なく無視して頂いて構いません。また、指定のない点や不明な点はすべて作者様の裁量にお任せします。\n妄想全開のリクエストとなってしまい大変恐縮ですが、何卒、ご検討の程よろしくお願いいたします。", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ktn400AF_Cmpn/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2688903, "client_id": 1871593, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7c141d39/uploads/origins/a8ae7baa-11c2-4cdb-85fd-9480161d929e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=afbfbde0eec2ea6608069bd4abe9b96c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7c141d39/uploads/origins/a8ae7baa-11c2-4cdb-85fd-9480161d929e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=afbfbde0eec2ea6608069bd4abe9b96c, https://si.imgix.net/7c141d39/uploads/origins/a8ae7baa-11c2-4cdb-85fd-9480161d929e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=00c368a45e477374a42d38178ab99e44 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7c141d39/uploads/origins/a8ae7baa-11c2-4cdb-85fd-9480161d929e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d5ef76b520d335e965f0f4778659ce3b 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7c141d39/uploads/origins/a8ae7baa-11c2-4cdb-85fd-9480161d929e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4c881ffbce415cbe0359ddf82b4a2379", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7c141d39/uploads/origins/a8ae7baa-11c2-4cdb-85fd-9480161d929e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4c881ffbce415cbe0359ddf82b4a2379, https://si.imgix.net/7c141d39/uploads/origins/a8ae7baa-11c2-4cdb-85fd-9480161d929e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=438e7a6b5189522270469cffb5ec6e18 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7c141d39/uploads/origins/a8ae7baa-11c2-4cdb-85fd-9480161d929e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c4f645a28b5eb542c1f33b1a4df91e9b 3x"}, "body": "お初にお目にかかります。りちうむいおんと申します。\n\nイラストのリクエストになります。お受けいただけると幸いです。\n\n・東京臨海高速鉄道71-000形をTOMIXパッケージ風に描いていただきたいです。\n\n・構図等はお任せしますが、品番は71101、その他情報類はTOMIX 98763 りんかい線70-000形に準拠していただくようお願いします。", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ktn400AF_Cmpn/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2688903, "client_id": 3168132, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6bf7ec33/uploads/origins/9f978f11-286c-4689-9f9f-6749227e03a0?bg=%2